        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "Cobwebs and dust blanket HILL HOUSE\u2019s forgotten glory days.\r\nNELL
          coughs, and pulls out her JOURNAL. The air hangs heavy with the scent of
          must and mildew. Space is empty, carrying with it only a sense of acrid
          loneliness."
        type: 0
